Course Registration
There is a group of N friends who wish to enroll in a course together. The course has a maximum capacity of M students that can register for it.If there are K other students who already enrolled in the course,determine if it will still be possible for all N friends to do so or not.

input
3
2 50 27
5 40 38
100 100 0

output
Yes
No
Yes

====
t=int(input())
for i in range(t):
    n,m,k=map(int,input().split())
    if m-k>=n:
        print("YES")
    else:
        print("NO")
